  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3/refs/heads/main/farm3x3-banner-with-icon-halfsize.png\" alt=\"Banner with the icon of the data pack with the text &quot;Farm 3x3&quot; next to it.\"></p>\n<h1>Farm3x3</h1>\n<p>Farm 3x3 是一款模组，当你手持锄头时，它会在 3x3 的区域内自动收获作物。<br>\n如果你在主手或副手持有锄头，作物还会自动重新种植。（适用于 Minecraft 1.21+ 及 Farm3x3 2.2.0+）</p>\n<h2>模组兼容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>阅读<a href=\"https://github.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3/wiki/Supported-Crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此维基页面</a>以查看所有支持的 vanilla 和模组作物列表。</li>\n<li>可能需要额外的数据包来支持模组，请参阅维基页面获取更多信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>注意事项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>要配置或移除该模组，请运行 <code>/function farm3x3:settings</code>。</li>\n<li>该模组在创造模式下无效。</li>\n<li>这是一个重新打包为模组的数���包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>链接</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fcNHrBKWb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/farm-3x3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f4RWVg8MgAj\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/farm-3x3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下载数据包版本</a></p>",
